  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till MAPP/OAS Colombia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to MAPP/OAS Colombia - Support to peace via MAPP/OAS (2016-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationen f&#xf6;r amerikanska staters s&#xe4;rskilda fredsmission i Colombia (MAPP/OAS) har inkommit med en f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan till den svenska ambassaden i Bogot&#xe1; om finansiering om 30 miljoner SEK f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja genomf&#xf6;randet av deras strategiska plan 2016&#x2013;2021. Finansieringen g&#xe4;ller under perioden 1 juli 2019 &#x2013; 21 december 2021. Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att bidra till genf&#xf6;randet av Colombias fredspolitik genom uppf&#xf6;ljning, medf&#xf6;ljning och st&#xf6;d till specifika insatser inom utvalda tematiska omr&#xe5;den. Genom att l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer till colombianska staten vill MAPP/OAS st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r en l&#xe5;ngvarig och h&#xe5;llbar fred, i enlighet med mandatet mellan Organisationen f&#xf6;r amerikanska stater och Colombias regering.
Verksamheten fokuserar p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande tre huvudomr&#xe5;den: fredsbyggande; s&#xe4;kerhetsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden och territoriell dynamik; &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsr&#xe4;ttvisa samt avv&#xe4;pning, demobilisering och &#xe5;terintegrering (DDR).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention supports the implementation of MAPP/OAS&#xb4;s country programme (Organization of American States/Mission to Support the Peace Process in Colombia) . Its primary objective is to assist the Colombian government in its implementation of the peace policy through comprehensive monitoring, accompaniment, and support for targeted activities across key thematic areas. The OAS-mission provides strategic recommendations to the Government of Colombia for the consolidation of a lasting peace. The country programme focuses on three main areas: Peacebuilding; Security conditions and territorial dynamics; and transitional justice, including disarmament, demobilization, and reintegration (DDR). A gender perspective is integrated throughout the country programme, both in staff recruitment and in the design and implementation of activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Mission to support the Peace Process of the Organization of American States (MAPP/OAS) is to support the Colombian States peace policy to contribute to the consolidation of a long-lasting peace.
This will be achieved through specific results planned in the three main thematic areas:
1) Peacebuilding
2) Security conditions and territorial dynamics
3)Transitional Justice and disarmament, demobilization and reintegration (DDR)
The activities within these areas are implemented through a comprehensive monitoring, accompaniment, and support, by the 18 regional offices in the country and the central office in Bogot&#xe1;.</narrative>
  </description>
